ction.[NEWLINE]- AcStop Tr -> iAggregatedPositiveMemoryAcceptedStopTradingAffection.[NEWLINE]- VotedForUs -> iAggregatedPositiveMemoryVotedForUsAffection.[NEWLINE]- Event Good -> iAggregatedPositiveMemoryEventGoodToUsAffection.[NEWLINE]- LiberatedC -> iAggregatedPositiveMemoryLiberatedCitiesAffection.[NEWLINE]- Indep -> iAggregatedPositiveMemoryIndependenceAffection.[NEWLINE]- Tr Tech -> iAggregatedPositiveMemoryTradedTechToUsAffection.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Negative Memory Resentments:[NEWLINE]- D.W -> iAggregatedNegativeMemoryDeclaredWarResentment.[NEWLINE]- D.W onFr -> iAggregatedNegativeMemoryDeclaredWarOnFriendResentment.[NEWLINE]- HirWAlly -> iAggregatedNegativeMemoryHiredWarAllyResentment.[NEWLINE]- Nuked Us -> iAggregatedNegativeMemoryNukedUsResentment.[NEWLINE]- Nuked Fr -> iAggregatedNegativeMemoryNukedFriendResentment.[NEWLINE]- RazC -> iAggregatedNegativeMemoryRazedCityResentment.[NEWLINE]- RazHolyC -> iAggregatedNegativeMemoryRazedHolyCityResentment.[NEWLINE]- Spy Caught -> iAggregatedNegativeMemorySpyCaughtResentment.[NEWLINE]- RefHelpUs -> iAggregatedNegativeMemoryRefusedHelpResentment.[NEWLINE]- Rej D -> iAggregatedNegativeMemoryRejectedDemandResentment.[NEWLINE]- Dn Relig -> iAggregatedNegativeMemoryDeniedReligionResentment.[NEWLINE]- Dn Civic -> iAggregatedNegativeMemoryDeniedCivicResentment.[NEWLINE]- Dn JoinW -> iAggregatedNegativeMemoryDeniedJoinWarResentment.[NEWLINE]- Dn StopTr -> iAggregatedNegativeMemoryDeniedStopTradingResentment.[NEWLINE]- StoppedTr -> iAggregatedNegativeMemoryStoppedTradingResentment.[NEWLINE]- TrEmbargo -> iAggregatedNegativeMemoryHiredTradeEmbargoResentment.[NEWLINE]- Made D -> iAggregatedNegativeMemoryMadeDemandResentment.[NEWLINE]- VotedAgUs -> iAggregatedNegativeMemoryVotedAgainstUsResentment.[NEWLINE]- Event Bad -> iAggregatedNegativeMemoryEventBadToUsResentment.[NEWLINE]- CancVassal -> iAggregatedNegativeMemoryCancelledVassalAgreementResentment.[NEWLINE]- Recent W -> iAggregatedNegativeMemoryDeclaredWarRecentResentment.